  "transcript": [
    {
      "approx_t": 0.0,
      "text": "The eye area can make or break a face."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 2.5,
      "text": "Here are two simple steps with the highest return to naturally improve it."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 6.0,
      "text": "Step one is that most people only focus on the eye color,"
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 8.5,
      "text": "but there's something equally important that makes eyes look attractive: clarity and contrast."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 13.5,
      "text": "It doesn't matter if your eyes are blue, green, or brown."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 16.0,
      "text": "If your sclera looks yellow or red, the eyes will look tired and less healthy."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 20.0,
      "text": "That's why one of the oldest tricks is simply using preservative-free eye drops to keep your eyes hydrated and clear."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 25.5,
      "text": "The second step is to frame your eyes correctly."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 27.5,
      "text": "Brow shape can heavily influence the perceived tilt of the eyes."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 30.5,
      "text": "If your canthal tilt is neutral or negative, lifting the outer third of your brow visually extends the tilt upwards."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 36.0,
      "text": "Brows can also help fix spacing."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 38.5,
      "text": "If your eyes sit too close, trimming the inner ends widens the gap."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 41.0,
      "text": "If they sit too far apart, growing the inner ends inwards tightens it."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 45.0,
      "text": "And finally, you can use your brows to even out asymmetries."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 47.5,
      "text": "For example, if one eye sits lower than the other, shaping that brow slightly higher visually levels them."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 52.5,
      "text": "There are dozens of small signals like these that are shaping how your face is perceived."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 56.5,
      "text": "We break down all of them over at Qoves.com."
    }
  ],
